i'd still suggest following the strategy, below.  you may need to increase
the prior value in _AMempri to get it to work.  but be aware that the more
missingness, the more model-dependent the imputations will be.  i.e., if
there is no information even Amelia won't find it for you!

Best of luck,
Gary

